  "description": "This protocol is designed for Twist 96-PLex Library Prep. We use the EPmotion 5075 to add sample barcodes (can also easily be done manually with a multichannel pipette). This is a continuation of the &#34;EPMotion - Normalization and Randomization&#34; protocol. ",
