  "materials_text": "Please see Twist 96 Plex Protocol on Twist Bioscience Site for full list of materials needed\n\n\nEquipment\n1. epMotion 5075\n1. 8 Channel Dispensing Tool (50uL) **Catalog No.\u00a0960001044**\n1. Qubit Flourometer\n1. Bioanalyzer\n1. Nanodrop\n1. Pipettes \n1. Multichannel pipette (10ul) if EPmotion is not available. \n\n\n\nConsumables\n1. 1-50uL epT.I.P.S. Motion **Catalog No.\u00a00030014413**\n1. Qubit HS Assay\n1. Tapestation D1000\n1. Reagent Wells\n1. Ultrapure DI Water\n1. Pipette Tips: 10ul, 200ul, 1000ul \n\n",
