   {
    "id": 1393297,
    "guid": "7C54AA00CA3A11EC851EA99E15DE2150",
    "previous_id": 1393298,
    "previous_guid": "35AB9040CA3B11EC851EA99E15DE2150",
    "section": "<p>Adding Primer A with EPmotion </p>",
    "section_color": "#A492FF",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Download and import  [50% GC Content Adapters.export7](https://content.protocols.io/files/hgdabrntx.export7) and  [Low GC Content Adapters.export7](https://content.protocols.io/files/hgdbbrntx.export7) \n1. Depending on the GC content of the species you are working with, choose the protocol accordingly. \n1. Use 50% GC Content Adapters if samples have GC content between 40% - 60% \n1. Use Low GC Primers if samples have GC content below 40%\n1. Use High GC Primers if samples have GC content above 60% \n\n",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 61801,
